    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br><i>Shards of the Banished</i> is a soulslike action RPG set in a post-apocalyptic dark fantasy world. You play as a lone warrior cast into a land consumed by glimmering darkness and the ashes of what was once a prosperous realm. Survive brutal encounters, explore ruined landscapes, and harness the mysterious power of crystals to uncover the truth behind your banishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Combat System</strong>: Master a stamina-based melee combat system with dodge rolls, parries, and powerful finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong>: Unlock new abilities through a detailed skill tree tailored to your combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Weapons</strong>: Discover and upgrade 2 distinct weapon types, each with its own moveset and combat flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talismans</strong>: Collect and equip a variety of talismans that grant passive bonuses, stat boosts, and special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong>: Face off against 3 deadly bosses, each with unique mechanics and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Design</strong>: Navigate interconnected areas filled with secrets, traps, shortcuts, and hidden lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: Multiple builds and playstyles encourage experimentation and repeated playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World</strong>: Experience a haunting soundtrack and environmental storytelling that deepen the immersion.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br><i>Shards of the Banished</i> is a soulslike action RPG set in a post-apocalyptic dark fantasy world. You play as a lone warrior cast into a land consumed by glimmering darkness and the ashes of what was once a prosperous realm. Survive brutal encounters, explore ruined landscapes, and harness the mysterious power of crystals to uncover the truth behind your banishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Combat System</strong>: Master a stamina-based melee combat system with dodge rolls, parries, and powerful finishers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong>: Unlock new abilities through a detailed skill tree tailored to your combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Weapons</strong>: Discover and upgrade 2 distinct weapon types, each with its own moveset and combat flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talismans</strong>: Collect and equip a variety of talismans that grant passive bonuses, stat boosts, and special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong>: Face off against 3 deadly bosses, each with unique mechanics and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Design</strong>: Navigate interconnected areas filled with secrets, traps, shortcuts, and hidden lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: Multiple builds and playstyles encourage experimentation and repeated playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World</strong>: Experience a haunting soundtrack and environmental storytelling that deepen the immersion.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Shards of the Banished is a dark fantasy action-RPG set in a cursed medieval world. A fallen king, a cursed queen, and a power-hungry usurper have plunged the land into ruin. As the exiled heir, you must rise, face powerful foes, and reclaim what is rightfully yours.",
